{"seq":2,"slug":"alfred-workflows","title":"Alfred Workflows 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/launcher-automation/alfred-workflows","wordCount":1130,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"alfred-workflows-实战\">Alfred Workflows 实战</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Alfred 是 macOS 平台上历史最悠久的效率启动器，其 Workflow 系统自 2012 年推出以来已形成了庞大的生态。与 Raycast 的代码优先理念不同，Alfred Workflows 采用可视化节点编排模型——通过拖拽连接 Trigger、Input、Action 和 Output 节点来构建自动化逻辑。这种设计让非程序员也能快速构建复杂流程，同时为开发者保留了通过 Script Filter 和外部脚本深度定制的能力。</p>\n<p>Alfred 5（2024 年至今的主力版本）在性能、Universal Actions 和 Automation Tasks 方面做了大量改进。本文将系统讲解 Workflow 的架构原理与高效构建方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"workflow-节点模型\">Workflow 节点模型</h3><p>Alfred Workflow 的本质是一个有向无环图（DAG），由以下四类节点组成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Trigger → Input → Action → Output&#10;&#10;├── Hotkey          ├── Script Filter    ├── Run Script      ├── Post Notification&#10;├── Keyword         ├── File Filter      ├── Open File       ├── Copy to Clipboard&#10;├── Remote          ├── List Filter      ├── Open URL        ├── Write Text File&#10;├── Snippet         │                    ├── Run NSAppleScript├── Play Sound&#10;├── External        │                    ├── Terminal Command │&#10;└── File Action     │                    └── Automation Task  │\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Trigger → Input → Action → Output</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Hotkey          ├── Script Filter    ├── Run Script      ├── Post Notification</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Keyword         ├── File Filter      ├── Open File       ├── Copy to Clipboard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Remote          ├── List Filter      ├── Open URL        ├── Write Text File</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Snippet         │                    ├── Run NSAppleScript├── Play Sound</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── External        │                    ├── Terminal Command │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── File Action     │                    └── Automation Task  │</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"script-filter-协议\">Script Filter 协议</h3><p>Script Filter 是 Alfred 最强大的 Input 节点，它通过 JSON 协议与外部脚本通信：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;items&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;uid&quot;: &quot;unique-id&quot;,&#10;      &quot;title&quot;: &quot;显示标题&quot;,&#10;      &quot;subtitle&quot;: &quot;副标题描述&quot;,&#10;      &quot;arg&quot;: &quot;传递给下游节点的参数&quot;,&#10;      &quot;icon&quot;: { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;icon.png&quot; },&#10;      &quot;mods&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;cmd&quot;: { &quot;subtitle&quot;: &quot;⌘ 按下时的替代操作&quot;, &quot;arg&quot;: &quot;alt-arg&quot; },&#10;        &quot;alt&quot;: { &quot;subtitle&quot;: &quot;⌥ 按下时的替代操作&quot;, &quot;arg&quot;: &quot;alt-arg2&quot; }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;valid&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;autocomplete&quot;: &quot;自动补全文本&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;rerun&quot;: 1.0&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"uid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unique-id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"显示标题\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"subtitle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"副标题描述\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"arg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"传递给下游节点的参数\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"icon\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"icon.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"mods\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"cmd\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"subtitle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"⌘ 按下时的替代操作\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"arg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alt-arg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"alt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"subtitle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"⌥ 按下时的替代操作\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"arg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alt-arg2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"valid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"autocomplete\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"自动补全文本\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rerun\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键字段说明：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>uid</strong>：结果唯一标识，Alfred 用它学习用户偏好排序</li>\n<li><strong>arg</strong>：动作参数，传递给连接的 Action 节点</li>\n<li><strong>mods</strong>：修饰键变体，允许一个结果关联多个操作</li>\n<li><strong>rerun</strong>：秒数，Script Filter 会自动重新执行（适合轮询）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"变量与数据流\">变量与数据流</h3><p>Alfred 的变量系统分为三个作用域：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>设置方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Workflow Environment</td>\n<td>全局持久</td>\n<td>Workflow 配置面板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flow Variables</td>\n<td>单次执行</td>\n<td><code>{var:name}</code> 占位符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Script Output</td>\n<td>节点间传递</td>\n<td>stdout / JSON</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在脚本中设置流变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 通过特殊 JSON 输出设置变量&#10;cat &lt;&lt; EOF&#10;{&quot;alfredworkflow&quot;: {&#10;  &quot;arg&quot;: &quot;result&quot;,&#10;  &quot;variables&quot;: {&quot;token&quot;: &quot;abc123&quot;, &quot;count&quot;: &quot;42&quot;}&#10;}}&#10;EOF\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 通过特殊 JSON 输出设置变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">{\"alfredworkflow\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"arg\": \"result\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"variables\": {\"token\": \"abc123\", \"count\": \"42\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"构建一个项目切换器-workflow\">构建一个项目切换器 Workflow</h3><p>这个 Workflow 实现：输入关键字快速切换到任意代码项目目录并打开 IDE。</p>\n<h4 id=\"step-1-创建-script-filter\">Step 1：创建 Script Filter</h4><p>语言选择 <code>/bin/bash</code>，脚本内容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 搜索 ~/Projects 下的所有 git 仓库&#10;query=&quot;$1&quot;&#10;items=&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;while IFS= read -r dir; do&#10;  name=$(basename &quot;$dir&quot;)&#10;  if [[ &quot;$name&quot; == *&quot;$query&quot;* ]] || [[ -z &quot;$query&quot; ]]; then&#10;    items+=&quot;{\\&quot;title\\&quot;:\\&quot;$name\\&quot;,\\&quot;subtitle\\&quot;:\\&quot;$dir\\&quot;,\\&quot;arg\\&quot;:\\&quot;$dir\\&quot;,\\&quot;icon\\&quot;:{\\&quot;path\\&quot;:\\&quot;folder.png\\&quot;}},&quot;&#10;  fi&#10;done &lt; &lt;(find ~/Projects -maxdepth 2 -name &quot;.git&quot; -type d | sed &#39;s/\\/.git$//&#39;)&#10;&#10;echo &quot;{\\&quot;items\\&quot;:[${items%,}]}&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 搜索 ~/Projects 下的所有 git 仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IFS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">basename</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [[ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$query</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [[ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-z</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$query</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">title</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">subtitle</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$dir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">arg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$dir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">icon</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">folder.png</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}},\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/Projects </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-maxdepth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \".git\" </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/\\/.git$//')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">items</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:[${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,}]}\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"step-2-连接-action-节点\">Step 2：连接 Action 节点</h4><p>从 Script Filter 输出连接两个 Action：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Run Script</strong>（默认回车）：<code>code &quot;{query}&quot;</code> 在 VS Code 打开</li>\n<li><strong>Terminal Command</strong>（⌘+回车）：<code>cd &quot;{query}&quot; &amp;&amp; exec $SHELL</code> 打开终端</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"step-3-添加-hotkey-trigger\">Step 3：添加 Hotkey Trigger</h4><p>设置 <code>⌥+P</code> 作为全局热键，直接唤出项目列表。</p>\n<p>整个 Workflow 的数据流如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    H[&quot;Hotkey ⌥+P 唤起&quot;] --&gt; SF[&quot;Script Filter:扫描 ~/Projects 下的 git 仓库&quot;]&#10;    SF --&gt; Q{用户选择项目}&#10;    Q --&gt;|回车| V[&quot;Run Script:用 VS Code 打开&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|⌘+回车| T[&quot;Terminal Command:cd 到项目目录&quot;]\">graph TD\n    H[\"Hotkey ⌥+P 唤起\"] --&gt; SF[\"Script Filter:扫描 ~/Projects 下的 git 仓库\"]\n    SF --&gt; Q{用户选择项目}\n    Q --&gt;|回车| V[\"Run Script:用 VS Code 打开\"]\n    Q --&gt;|⌘+回车| T[\"Terminal Command:cd 到项目目录\"]</pre><h3 id=\"外部脚本集成模式\">外部脚本集成模式</h3><p>对于复杂逻辑，推荐将核心逻辑写在独立脚本中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env python3&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;Alfred Script Filter: 搜索 Notion 数据库&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;import json&#10;import sys&#10;import urllib.request&#10;&#10;query = sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) &gt; 1 else &quot;&quot;&#10;NOTION_TOKEN = os.environ.get(&quot;NOTION_TOKEN&quot;, &quot;&quot;)&#10;DATABASE_ID = os.environ.get(&quot;DATABASE_ID&quot;, &quot;&quot;)&#10;&#10;def search_notion(query):&#10;    url = f&quot;https://api.notion.com/v1/databases/{DATABASE_ID}/query&quot;&#10;    headers = {&#10;        &quot;Authorization&quot;: f&quot;Bearer {NOTION_TOKEN}&quot;,&#10;        &quot;Notion-Version&quot;: &quot;2022-06-28&quot;,&#10;        &quot;Content-Type&quot;: &quot;application/json&quot;&#10;    }&#10;    payload = json.dumps({&#10;        &quot;filter&quot;: {&quot;property&quot;: &quot;Name&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: {&quot;contains&quot;: query}}&#10;    }).encode()&#10;&#10;    req = urllib.request.Request(url, data=payload, headers=headers, method=&quot;POST&quot;)&#10;    with urllib.request.urlopen(req) as resp:&#10;        return json.loads(resp.read())&#10;&#10;results = search_notion(query)&#10;items = []&#10;for page in results.get(&quot;results&quot;, []):&#10;    title = page[&quot;properties&quot;][&quot;Name&quot;][&quot;title&quot;][0][&quot;plain_text&quot;]&#10;    url = page[&quot;url&quot;]&#10;    items.append({&quot;title&quot;: title, &quot;arg&quot;: url, &quot;subtitle&quot;: &quot;Open in Notion&quot;})&#10;&#10;print(json.dumps({&quot;items&quot;: items}))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env python3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"Alfred Script Filter: 搜索 Notion 数据库\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sys</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> urllib.request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=